  "description": "An OS-style windowed desktop for the Umbraco backoffice. Launch content, media, settings and other sections as real draggable, resizable windows and work in several of them side by side — edit on the left while you watch the result on the right. Includes a grouped app launcher with pinnable favourites, a taskbar, and per-app window chrome, all styled to match the backoffice.",
